# Copy this file to `.env` at the senpai repo root and fill in your credentials:
#   cp example.env .env
#
# `.env` is gitignored — never commit your credentials.
#
# `k8s/launch.py` reads GITHUB_TOKEN in this order:
#   1. $GITHUB_TOKEN in your shell env
#   2. .env at the senpai repo root (this file, after you rename it)
#   3. `gh auth token`
#
# `k8s/launch.py` reads ANTHROPIC_API_KEY in this order:
#   1. $ANTHROPIC_API_KEY in your shell env
#   2. .env at the senpai repo root (this file, after you rename it)
# It is required only when a configured model uses the `anthropic/` prefix.
#
# `k8s/launch.py` reads OPENAI_API_KEY in this order:
#   1. $OPENAI_API_KEY in your shell env
#   2. .env at the senpai repo root (this file, after you rename it)
# It is required only when a configured model uses the `openai/` prefix.
#
# `k8s/launch.py` reads EXA_API_KEY in this order:
#   1. $EXA_API_KEY in your shell env
#   2. .env at the senpai repo root (this file, after you rename it)
#
# `k8s/launch.py` reads WANDB_API_KEY in this order:
#   1. $WANDB_API_KEY in your shell env
#   2. .env at the senpai repo root (this file, after you rename it)
#
# HF_TOKEN and the official submission tokens are optional and use the same
# shell-then-.env resolution. Configure only the submission CLI in use:
# MLXFAST_API_TOKEN for legacy MLXFast launches or YUKON_API_TOKEN for Yukon.
#
# To provide another credential to every advisor and student environment, add
# it here and list its environment-variable name under
# `custom_secret_env_names` in `senpai.local.yaml`. The launcher reads the shell
# first, then this file, and fails when a listed value is missing. For example:
#   DATASET_LICENSE_KEY=abc123
#
# Prefer a deliberately created classic PAT (`ghp_...`) for launch, not a
# copied GitHub CLI OAuth token (`gho_...`). Grant only the repository access
# needed to clone, push, and manage PRs on the `target_repo_url`; organization-
# wide read access is not required.

GITHUB_TOKEN=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
OPENAI_API_KEY=
EXA_API_KEY=
WANDB_API_KEY=
HF_TOKEN=
MLXFAST_API_TOKEN=
YUKON_API_TOKEN=
